    [missing_case] review-finishes-normally/empty-request-returns-empty-result
      An empty test_ids input returns SandboxRunResult(outcomes=[]), which can leave the review with no observed outcome at all rather than a normal completed review result if the caller expects at least one test outcome to be reported.
